{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade Tycoon Life Simulator</strong> is a simulation that invites players to gain wealth and power in the world of trade. Players can build and grow their businesses in a dynamic economy while earning income from various side jobs such as fishing, pizza delivery, shipping, and factory work. You can buy and sell goods through trade, open businesses, and grow your wealth. Additionally, in an open world, you can open your own shop, engage in trade, and personalize your store while continuing to live your life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608020?t=1744715074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608020?t=1744715074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/796b7586716cc51ede71f11d7ce2518cab9020e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744715074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/796b7586716cc51ede71f11d7ce2518cab9020e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744715074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade Tycoon Life Simulator</strong> is a simulation that invites players to gain wealth and power in the world of trade. Players can build and grow their businesses in a dynamic economy while earning income from various side jobs such as fishing, pizza delivery, shipping, and factory work. You can buy and sell goods through trade, open businesses, and grow your wealth. Additionally, in an open world, you can open your own shop, engage in trade, and personalize your store while continuing to live your life.</p>","developers":["Reme Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/